# General Coding Rules

This project prioritizes:

- simplicity
- readability
- maintainability
- modular code

Avoid:

- unnecessary libraries
- premature optimization
- complex design patterns

When generating code:

- explain unfamiliar concepts
- prefer explicit code
- avoid magic behavior
- keep functions short
- add short, descriptive comments for files/functions/components when useful
- use explicit, context-rich names to avoid ambiguous duplicates

The user is experienced in frontend but beginner in backend.

Always explain backend logic clearly.